     &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;Information on how businesses and sponsors can participate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
