&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Book&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:open sans,open sans_embeddedfont,open sans_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Set in Portland, Oregon, Pattee&rsquo;s powerful debut novel tells a gripping story of survival, resilience, and human connection after a massive 9.0 earthquake strikes the Pacific Northwest &mdash; an especially resonant story for our community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:wordvisicarriagereturn_msfontservice,open sans,open sans_embeddedfont,open sans_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family:wordvisicarriagereturn_msfontservice,arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Tilt&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:open sans,open sans_embeddedfont,open sans_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;is longlisted for the&nbsp;Andrew Carnegie Medal of Excellence in Fiction, A&lt;em&gt;&nbsp;New York Times&lt;/em&gt; Book Review Editor's Choice, and&amp;nbsp;was&amp;nbsp;recently named to&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Scientific American&rsquo;s&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:open sans,open sans_embeddedfont,open sans_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&nbsp;list of the Best Fiction of 2025.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tilt&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:open sans,open sans_embeddedfont,open sans_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&nbsp;has captured national attention.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

