&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Detectives from the Violent Crimes Unit were able to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;Silva as the suspect&amp;nbsp;of the earlier&amp;nbsp;shooting. It was reported that Silva was arguing with the victim at the time the victim was shot.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
