&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Presale &lt;span style="color:rgb(0,0,255)"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.etix.com/ticket/p/33387944/kameron-marlow-with-special-guest-astoria-clatsop-county-fair-expo"&gt;concert tickets&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;are available now.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;General Admission: $30&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Front-of-Stage Section: $45&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ticketing fees are not included. General Admission Prices will increase the week of the fair.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Concert VIP sponsorship packages are available and include access to the VIP section along with promotional recognition and visibility during the event.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Clatsop County Fair is supported by community partners including:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

