&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For more information, , please see &lt;a href="mailto:sherwoodoregon.gov/library"&gt;sherwoodoregon.gov/library&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="mailto:askusSPL@sherwoodoregon.gov"&gt;askusSPL@sherwoodoregon.gov&lt;/a&gt; or call 503-625-6688. For more information about the Tualatin Lions Club, please email &lt;a href="mailto:tualatinlions@gmail.com"&gt;tualatinlions@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

