&lt;p&gt;The Multnomah Education Service District&amp;nbsp;Board of Directors will meet in Regular Session at 6:00 p.m.&amp;nbsp;on March 17, 2026.&amp;nbsp; At the end of the Regular Session meeting, the Board will move to Executive Session under&amp;nbsp;(ORS 192.660(2)(i))-&amp;nbsp;To review and evaluate the employment-related performance of the chief executive officer, employee or staff member who does not request an open hearing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;
