&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size:10pt"&gt; Heritage Prayer Service celebrating the Sisters of St. Mary of Oregon&rsquo;s 140-year legacy and historic endowment gift&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Who:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size:10pt"&gt; Second-grade students, Sisters of St. Mary of Oregon and Valley Catholic School teachers and administrators&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;When:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size:10pt"&gt; Wednesday March 18, 2026, 9:30 a.m.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Where:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size:10pt"&gt; Sisters of St. Mary of Oregon Chapel - 4440 SW 148th Ave, Beaverton, OR 97078&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

