Facebook at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.facebook.com/crownpointcountrymuseum" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0069a6;" target="_blank"&gt;facebook.com/crownpointcountrymuseum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Kelso School District community is invited to preview the proposed 6-12 English Language Arts curriculum and materials for the 2026-2027 school year. The materials are available for viewing at the Ruth E. Clark District Office April 13 through April 24 between the hours of 8:00 am and 4:00 pm, Monday through Friday.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After reviewing the proposed curriculum, community members have the opportunity to provide their thoughts and feedback.&lt;/p&gt;

