&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&ldquo;Health care careers continue to be among the most in demand in our region,&rdquo;&amp;nbsp;Virginia Chambers, CCC director of health sciences,&amp;nbsp;said. &ldquo;This event is designed to help students explore their options, understand program pathways and take the next step toward a meaningful career serving the community.&rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

